description	"The War Droid

This combat droid strikes a balance between on the cost-quality scale between a B1 battledroid and a hunter-killer Unit like the IG. It is designed to be resilient to blaster fire, though also comes equipped with a cryo-thrower to deal with the threat of CQC. 

^2Weaponry:
- War Droid Blaster (EE-4 1)
- Cryo-Thrower ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Shield Recharge (1)
- Magnetic Plating
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 3 Reinforcements (CTF: 7.5s Respawn)
- Assemble (1)

^2Strengths^7: Relatively resilent to blaster fire, immune to jedi mindtricks, poison, sonic, drowning, and locational damage. 
^1Weaknesses^7: Slow, low firepower and relies heavily on shields for defense. Highly vulnerable to Pulse Grenades."